{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13101350","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13101350","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1310135001:0":{"text":"怖い思いをさせてすまなかったな。生きた屍たちは私たちが倒した。君たちは大丈夫か？","source_cn":"诸位，抱歉，让你们受惊吓了。那些活死人已经被我们制服了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14943CAF70186612","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310135002:0":{"text":"私たちは大丈夫です。ただ、この子が……","source_cn":"我们倒是没什么，但这个小朋友……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAFE57359D4E4093","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310135003:1":{"text":"ローマンがすごく怯えているの、それに熱があるみたいで……","source_cn":"我的小罗曼，他吓坏了……现在似乎有些发烧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x694D07A48EA9A7DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310135004:0":{"text":"見せてくれ。ふむ、大丈夫だ。私が薬を作ろう。それを飲んで休めば治るはずだ。","source_cn":"让我看看……嗯，别担心，我为他熬煮一剂药，喝下之后好好...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C5E8A14C5203724","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310135005:0":{"text":"デューラ様に感謝！本当にありがとう！","source_cn":"艾雅在上，谢谢你们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE1B1835EE8D1062","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_titl